From: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 18:19:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: factorize SCMI impacts on STM32MP15 board

Add STM32MP SOC scmi device tree files and factorize support of SCMI
server for STM32MP15x family.

Change-Id: I08de0f1f5c8514591c8f45c102b024c6f1802afe
Signed-off-by: Patrick Delaunay <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/612290
Tested-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
